Option C: Der er et yndigt land.
[DA] Hvad hedder Danmarks nationalsang med tekst af Adam Oehlenschläger?  A: I Danmark er jeg født  |  B: Vi elsker vort land  |  C: Der er et yndigt land

97
00:10:13.426 --> 00:10:16.439
The answer is C: Der er et yndigt land.

98
00:10:16.389 --> 00:10:19.062
It appeared in the November 2020 exam.
[DA] ✔ C: Der er et yndigt land

99
00:10:19.612 --> 00:10:20.912
Question 4.

100
00:10:20.862 --> 00:10:29.087
Who wrote around the year 1200 the work Gesta Danorum, which contains stories about Denmark's history and Nordic mythology?

101
00:10:29.087 --> 00:10:31.012
Option A: Saxo.

102
00:10:31.012 --> 00:10:33.087
Option B: Brorson.

103
00:10:33.087 --> 00:10:35.112
Option C: Ansgar.
[DA] Hvem skrev omkring år 1200 værket Gesta Danorum, der indeholder fortællinger om Danmarks hi- storie og nordisk mytologi?  A: Saxo  |  B: Brorson  |  C: Ansgar

104
00:10:41.662 --> 00:10:43.637
The answer is A: Saxo.

105
00:10:43.587 --> 00:10:46.410
It appeared in the June 2021 exam.
[DA] ✔ A: Saxo

106
00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:48.423
