Option C: Ludvig Holberg.
[DA] Hvem skrev i 1722 komedien Jeppe på Bjerget?  A: Klaus Rifbjerg  |  B: Karen Blixen  |  C: Ludvig Holberg

111
00:11:06.226 --> 00:11:08.526
The answer is C: Ludvig Holberg.

112
00:11:08.476 --> 00:11:11.310
It appeared in the June 2021 exam.
[DA] ✔ C: Ludvig Holberg

113
00:11:11.860 --> 00:11:13.298
Question 6.

114
00:11:13.248 --> 00:11:16.373
